    "R: bowl held at 0.70 m (brief) by a standing second actor who bows over slightly bent knees; receiver distance from the cook (0.90 m root to root) is a design value",
    "F: who cooks/serves, portions, timing; the game's simulation clock drives the clips",
    "Limit: no stew in the ladle cup and no pouring stream (the bowl fill appears at 1.10 s)",
    "Limit: the kindling pile is not depleted and the fed stick is hidden on release (game-side visibility toggles)"
